# Bargain is an optional additional cost (GameActionUtil.java:479-481,
# OptionalCost.Bargain): Ornithopter is sacrificed as Candy Grapple is cast,
# so `X:Count$Bargained.5.3` (AbilityUtils.java:1708-1710) reads 5 and the
# 6/4 Craw Wurm gets -5/-5 and dies; unbargained it would get -3/-3 and live.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 B
tapformana human 3 B
queue paygeneric B
queue confirmpaycost true
queue sacrificechoice 4
queue targets 5
castspell human 1
resolvestack
